Package: com.raulkong89.bottommicredirect
Name: iPhone 4S Bottom Mic Redirect
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Forces iPhone 4S iOS 6 audio sessions away from modes that select the broken top microphone and toward the working bottom microphone.
Maintainer: RaulKong89
Author: RaulKong89 / ChatGPT
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 6.0)
